          <h2 class="s-h">Predictable agent work.<br/>Without surrendering the board.</h2>
          <p class="s-sub">Agents do useful work without root over the system. Approval is explicit, pickup is scoped per column, and every move is logged with the actor type. Ship agent-assisted workflows without losing oversight.</p>
